<title>USA: Burlington Northern to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Burlington Northern to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Northern Santa Fe Corp said on Thursday that its directors had authorized the repurchase of up to 10 million shares of the company's stock on the open market.</p>
<p>The company added that repurchased shares will be available to satisfy future requirements of various stock-based employee compensation programs.</p>
<p>BNSF operates railroads in North America.</p>
